===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[perfect]] [[pitch]]|-}}

# {{label|en|music}} The [[ability]] to identify a [[note]] by name, on hearing it and without the benefit of a [[reference]] note.
# {{label|en|less common}} The exact pitch of a note described by its [[frequency]] in [[vibrations]] per [[second]].

